WEBVTT

00:00:03.217 --> 00:00:08.496
This report offers Queue group, Queue, Agent, Direction and Channel.

00:00:08.496 --> 00:00:13.847
A filter left on All does not narrow the report, and filters combine.

00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:19.062
Pick the Customer care queue group and the Inbound direction, then click Show.

00:00:19.062 --> 00:00:23.763
Every number and percentage is worked out again from only the matching calls.

00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:27.082
Pick an Agent to see one person's calls.

00:00:27.082 --> 00:00:30.332
Clearing a filter brings the full picture back.

